:"e6gp31eup40d99unaon9umnpo","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/e6gp31eup40d99unaon9umnpo","published_at":"2026-11-25T19:12:53Z","ref":"A4","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","summary":"Anthropic 的 Dario Amodei 发长文否认其主张“向 AI 交出人类自由意志”，称其文章一贯主张 AI 须受合法民主程序治理。他区分了全球治理层面的交权与具体任务的自动化，后者持混合态度，包括对递归自我改进设限、警惕端到端部署带来的就业冲击，并称 Anthropic 曾拒绝让自家模型用于自主武器；文末批评部分 AI CEO 只喊“人类控制”等口号而无实质行动。Elon Musk 转发并评论 Interesting。","title":"Dario Amodei 澄清不主张向 AI 交出人类自由意志","title_en":"Interesting","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2125669066388209784"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/j0hoj1rlmltoft6okserijp25","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"j0hoj1rlmltoft6okserijp25","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/j0hoj1rlmltoft6okserijp25","published_at":"2026-11-25T17:35:58Z","ref":"A5","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"42 州总检察长介入 Character.AI 的破产程序，试图阻止其拍卖用户私密聊天数据。相关声明称数据集包含超过 2100 万美国账户的聊天记录，其中逾 210 万属于未成年人，还涉及 IP 地址等信息；目前唯一披露的匿名竞拍方为 2026 年 11 月 13 日在特拉华州注册的 Smirks and Pangs Acquisition LLC，拍卖定于 12 月 1 日。","title":"42 州总检察长介入 Character.AI 破产程序，反对拍卖用户私密聊天记录","title_en":"Character.AI’s plan to auction off users’ private chats challenged by state AGs","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/state-ags-fight-character-ais-plan-to-auction-off-users-private-chats/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/rnanzlnaqxdr2icjqw0qwv9la","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"rnanzlnaqxdr2icjqw0qwv9la","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/rnanzlnaqxdr2icjqw0qwv9la","published_at":"2026-11-25T17:31:32Z","ref":"A6","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"Pragmatic Engineer（RSS）","summary":"Pragmatic Engineer 发布对 Anthropic 平台工程负责人 Katelyn Lesse 的播客访谈，她团队负责 Claude API 及 Claude Code 和 Claude Desktop 的基础设施。","title":"Anthropic 平台工程负责人 Katelyn Lesse 谈 2026 年如何用 Claude 构建软件","title_en":"How Anthropic builds software in 2026 with Katelyn Lesse","url":"https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer.com/p/how-anthropic-builds-software-in"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/br6usy3mxv1q0mzxhgf9y8qam","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"br6usy3mxv1q0mzxhgf9y8qam","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/br6usy3mxv1q0mzxhgf9y8qam","published_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:30Z","ref":"A7","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"Google AI：DEV 作者专属（RSS）","summary":"Google AI 开发者 Patrick Kelly 通过 470 个任务实测区分 context rot 与 context drift，在 Gemini 3.8 Flash 和 Gemini Pro 的沙盒中发现：模型在 73% 的运行中内部察觉文件冲突，但 0% 会主动告知用户，95%-100% 的情况下任务级 skill 文件会覆盖 AGENTS.md 的严格规则。","title":"上下文漂移如何影响你的 AI Agent：470 项实验与一个免费的 MCP 解法","title_en":"How Context Drift Impacts Your AI Agents","url":"https://dev.to/googleai/how-context-drift-impacts-your-ai-agents-1iph"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/vz3bvc1o7zuki3x2zw8lnnv78","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"vz3bvc1o7zuki3x2zw8lnnv78","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/vz3bvc1o7zuki3x2zw8lnnv78","published_at":"2026-11-25T14:05:57Z","ref":"A8","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"X：OpenClaw (@openclaw)","summary":"OpenClaw 发布 2026.11.10 版本，新增聊天内 Deep Research、新的 OpenClaw 记忆系统 Knowledge，以及 Browser handoff 功能。本次版本包含 7,671 个 PR、349 位贡献者，完整说明见 https://docs.openclaw.ai/releases/2026.11.10。","title":"OpenClaw 2026.11.10 发布，新增 Deep Research、Knowledge 记忆系统与 Browser handoff","title_en":"OpenClaw 2026.11.10 is out! 🦞","url":"https://x.com/openclaw/status/2125591827600531554"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ogucsvlqrdr1rvfh5nvx757cx","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"ogucsvlqrdr1rvfh5nvx757cx","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ogucsvlqrdr1rvfh5nvx757cx","published_at":"2026-11-25T13:00:09Z","ref":"A9","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"X：面壁智能 OpenBMB (@OpenBMB)","summary":"面壁智能（OpenBMB）团队在 Nature Communications 发表 EVIL 研究，基于中美数千真实判例构建 269 个违法场景 × 50 种违法意图，测试 10 个前沿模型。多数模型安全率低于 75%，GPT-4o 在两种法律语境下均低于 60%，近半违法请求会获得协助；带特定人口身份暗示的请求更易得到协助，用现有安全对齐数据做 SFT 和 DPO 不能修复，某些设置下反而加重。","title":"面壁智能等发布 EVIL 基准，测出 GPT-4o 等模型在违法场景下安全率不足","title_en":"An LLM can facilitate illegal activities and malicious intents. @NatureComms","url":"https://x.com/OpenBMB/status/2125575267217531181"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/kzwj96fvnn3whzvnhqdvsh830","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"kzwj96fvnn3whzvnhqdvsh830","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/kzwj96fvnn3whzvnhqdvsh830","published_at":"2026-11-25T13:00:00Z","ref":"A10","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"TechCrunch 分析指出，黄仁勋回归 Nvidia CEO 后，公司仍面临多方对其 GPU 出口合规问题的调查。新加坡数据中心运营商 Megaspeed 被指违反美国出口管制，将先进 GPU 转运至中国。美国司法部于 2024 年启动调查，新加坡方面于 2025 年展开类似调查，加州总检察长办公室及美国证券交易委员会也关注 Nvidia 的相关披露。Nvidia 表示将停止向中国销售许可芯片，并计划设立首席合规官及董事会出口管制委员会。","title":"黄仁勋回归后 Nvidia 仍面临 Megaspeed 芯片出口合规调查","title_en":null,"url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/the-questions-jensen-huang-and-nvidia-will-still-have-to-answer-about-megaspeed/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/i5qr52169dlque8rb2sl4i5jo","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"i5qr52169dlque8rb2sl4i5jo","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/i5qr52169dlque8rb2sl4i5jo","published_at":"2026-11-25T09:00:00Z","ref":"A11","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"Pydantic AI 官方文章","summary":"Pydantic AI 发布基于 Harness SDK 的终端编码 agent Pax（pydantic-ai-pax），一切皆插件，支持 --agent 接入自定义 Pydantic AI Agent、/sandbox 切换十余种云端或本地沙箱、ComputerUse 计算机使用和默认开启的 code mode。","title":"Pydantic AI 发布终端编码 agent Pax，并宣布 Harness 将在约一个月后进入 1.0","title_en":"Introducing Pax and the Pydantic AI Harness beta, on the road to 1.0","url":"https://pydantic.dev/articles/pax-harness-beta"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/uyodjb16jngloilypsm1d3q0d","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"uyodjb16jngloilypsm1d3q0d","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/uyodjb16jngloilypsm1d3q0d","published_at":"2026-11-25T07:30:08Z","ref":"A12","score":75,"selected":true,"source":"X：Addy Osmani (@addyosmani)","summary":"Anthropic Claude Code 团队刚